# msuiter valgrind-leg suppressions -- reviewed artifact, authored in-tree.
#
# R ships no valgrind.supp of its own: falsified 2026-10-21 against the
# R 4.6.1 source tarball (full listing, zero valgrind hits). Distro packages
# maintain their own; this file is ours.
#
# Opening state: zero suppressions -- every memcheck report is treated as
# real. An entry is added only by adjudication of an observed report, each
# citing its evidence (log path + one-line reason). The canary pair in
# run_valgrind_leg.sh fails the leg if this file ever deadens detection.
#
# Entry format follows the memcheck suppressions grammar:
#   {
#      name=<label>
#      Memcheck:<kind-of-error>
#      ...frame fun/call lines...
#   }
